{"id":"wb-2-18","name":"万部华严经塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"万部华严经塔","text":"万部华严经塔，位于中华人民共和国内蒙古自治区呼和浩特市赛罕区巴彦街道白塔村，因塔身曾通体被刷为白色而俗称为“白塔”。该塔为八角形塔，塔身共有7层，第七层有通道通至塔顶。该塔始建于辽代，但具体时间不详。该塔曾为丰州古城当中的重要建筑物，元代末年，丰州古城毁于战火，该塔也受到严重损坏，塔刹和塔顶完全损毁。1978年时，该塔得以修复，并基本恢复原貌。1982年，万部华严经塔被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%87%E9%83%A8%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%A5%E7%BB%8F%E5%A1%94","revisionId":89426069,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89426069","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/44134a1f292237bfe04c18f3.jpg","title":"呼和浩特万部华严经塔2021_(2).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%91%BC%E5%92%8C%E6%B5%A9%E7%89%B9%E4%B8%87%E9%83%A8%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%A5%E7%BB%8F%E5%A1%942021_(2).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bf/%E5%91%BC%E5%92%8C%E6%B5%A9%E7%89%B9%E4%B8%87%E9%83%A8%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%A5%E7%BB%8F%E5%A1%942021_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"ScareCriterion12","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​呼和浩特市赛罕区 万部华严经塔","width":320,"height":475}}